129\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy}\n    expected: 0.283\n    format: {sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"doc_causal, HellaSwag accuracy.\"\n  singledoc.hellaswag.doc_causal.ci:\n    run_ids: [\"20260703_051129\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy_ci}\n    format: {kind: interval, sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"doc_causal, HellaSwag 95% CI.\"\n  singledoc.hellaswag.cross_doc_link:\n    run_ids: [\"20260703_050528\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy}\n    expected: 0.2905\n    format: {sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"cross_doc_link, HellaSwag accuracy.\"\n  singledoc.hellaswag.cross_doc_link.ci:\n    run_ids: [\"20260703_050528\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy_ci}\n    format: {kind: interval, sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"cross_doc_link, HellaSwag 95% CI.\"\n  singledoc.hellaswag.doc_concatenated:\n    run_ids: [\"20260703_052240\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy}\n    expected: 0.2845\n    format: {sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"doc_concatenated, HellaSwag accuracy.\"\n  singledoc.hellaswag.doc_concat_link:\n    run_ids: [\"20260703_053518\"]\n    source: {kind: eval, metric_path: \"hellaswag/doceval\", field: accuracy}\n    expected: 0.2865\n    format: {sig_figs: 3}\n    note: \"doc_concat_link, HellaSwag accuracy.\"\n\n  # === Traversal ablation: base-LM val loss (LITERAL / grounding debt) ===\n  # These are training-log validation cross-entropy, NOT in eval_results.json, so they\n  # cannot be eval-grounded yet (needs a `log` source, see provenance/README.md). Values\n  # from RESULTS.md; runs are the wiki traversal-matrix arms.\n  traversal.wiki_val_loss.graph:\n    run_ids: [run_20260717_173951_071952]\n    source: {kind: literal, value: 2.42}\n    units: \"val CE\"\n    format: {decimals: 2}\n    note: \"Base-LM final val loss, graph packing (bfs/dfs ~2.42)