{"actor":{"display":"Evin Tunador","id":"evintunador@gmail.com","type":"human"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"1\t# TAGSeq2TAGSeq — paper\n2\t\n3\tLaTeX source for the TAGSeq2TAGSeq paper.\n4\t\n5\t## Layout\n6\t- `main.tex` — top-level document (NeurIPS-style single-column preamble; swap for target venue).\n7\t- `sections/` — one `.tex` per section, `\\input` from `main.tex`.\n8\t- `bib/refs.bib` — consolidated BibTeX (assembled from the literature-review pass).\n9\t- `figures/` — figures (symlink or copy from ../docs/images and ../artifacts as needed).\n10\t- `PROJECT_SUMMARY_for_litreview.md` — the brief handed to the lit-review sub-agents.\n11\t\n12\t## Build\n13\t```bash\n14\tcd paper && latexmk -pdf main.tex   # or: pdflatex main && bibtex main && pdflatex main x2\n15\t```\n16\t\n17\t## Source material (in repo root)\n18\t- README.md — method overview + mask figures\n19\t- RESULTS*.md — all quantitative results\n20\t- INSTRUCTIONS.md — full pipeline\n21\t- docs/handoff_*.md — design notes\n22\t\n23\t\n24\t## Literature review status (2026-08-10)\n25\tTwo-round review complete, grounded in a 12-agent code-exploration pass\n26\t(`notes/code_briefs/*.md`, line-referenced per subsystem):\n27\t- `bib/refs.bib` — **531 verified entries** (118 round-1 broad + 413 round-2 deep),\n28\t  no duplicate keys, brace-balanced.\n29\t- `notes/LITREVIEW_PLAN.md`, `notes/REVIEWER_SHARED_BRIEF.md`, `notes/ROUND1_KEYS.txt` — review scaffolding.\n30\t- `sections/02_related_work.tex` — 9 paragraphs, ~168 citations, all keys resolve.\n31\tEvery note draws the train-on-structure vs retrieve-at-inference contrast. Some entries\n32\tcarry inline `% FLAG` venue/page caveats to reverify before camera-ready.\n33\t\n34\t\n35\t## Appendices (2026-08-10)\n36\tImplementation detail lives in `sections/appendices/` (indexed by `sections/A_appendix.tex`);\n37\tmain text stays lean and points here. All grounded in `notes/code_briefs/`, factual, no\n38\tresult-number dependencies, all \\cite keys