essionId: 5cbbe416-90e8-4a21-93e7-044acf862880\n  modified: 2026-08-24T03:56:22.796Z\n---\n\nOn the laptop `/fss-data` is not mounted and the project venv can't resolve (`tunalab`\nis a cluster-only editable dep), so:\n\n- Run the provenance tools as\n  `uv run --no-project --with pyyaml python scripts/{gen_values_tex,check_grounding}.py`.\n- `check_grounding.py` will emit ~650 \"run dirs gone but not archived\" warnings — that is\n  the missing mount, NOT deleted runs. **Never run `distill_runs.py --prune-missing` from\n  the laptop**; it would archive every record.\n- The checker's `\\val{}` regex scans `paper/sections/**/*.tex` including LaTeX comments,\n  so never write a literal `\\val{}` / `\\val{key}` in a comment.\n- Build: `cd paper && latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode main.tex` (TeX Live 2026 basic\n  is installed; ~49 pages as of 2026-08-23).\n\n**Why:** burned time on both the venv and the prune footgun. Related:\n[[paper-framing-2026-08-23]].\n","filePath":"/Users/evintunador/.claude/projects/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-tagseq2tagseq/memory/provenance-from-laptop.md","memdirStamped":true,"originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[],"type":"create","userModified":false},"type":"user","userType":"external","uuid":"94f55cad-1536-47a3-aa35-494980d75ab3","version":"2.1.241"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-08-24T03:57:56.344Z","schema":"conversation-ledger/v1"}
